# Templates

Page templates compose sections. They do not contain large HTML blocks. Put each section in `template-parts/`.

```php
get_header();
get_template_part( 'template-parts/home/hero' );
get_template_part( 'template-parts/home/featured-products' );
get_footer();
```

- Use semantic HTML5: `header`, `nav`, `main`, `article`, `section`, `footer`, and `button` for actions.
- WooCommerce overrides live in `woocommerce/` and change only the markup the design requires.
- Product images need descriptive `alt` text. Interactive controls need a visible `:focus-visible` style.
- One template part renders one region (hero, product card, mini cart, footer). Share the product card between the catalog and the homepage.
